{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10015_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6c352bfc21e534421702afbb63c82c161ba41174e8536a1d699ae28a656ccba4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a200e63290b758d32a9e6baf9ce8a725496bc005674e835a7df4055a3001018",
      "text": "Get drunk on us.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28210290415dbb536ee987bd1e2a43c717a71eb5b4ea4f1868c5381180c507d6",
      "text": "Beit接到了冬季限定鸡尾酒风软饮的\n公关宣传工作。他们决定出演配合产品概念、\n以高贵王子为形象的故事性广告短片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a200e63290b758d32a9e6baf9ce8a725496bc005674e835a7df4055a3001018",
      "text": "Get drunk on us.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a641b7db95e069820cee1141a157e3f5e598505f59c69b420f38fc180e23b50",
      "text": "恭二的公寓",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0bccb2fdc2f58d6947da7bc0d2ac94d8f2d3571709417f9d29272330cb25f9",
      "text": "“为我们沉醉吧”……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:befa5f0e30ebd65323e232bd469e18fbdb990004823fd7faf1a2c7fe8e68ee3b",
      "text": "唔——怎么都觉得不太顺口啊。\n是因为和平常喝的酒不一样，所以进不去状态吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a9a46572d14f07ec66c020fb268c75017b8f956393f416482f2d3034ba11a52",
      "text": "（这次的工作，是出演冬季限定鸡尾酒风饮料的广告，\n演唱联动歌曲，并参加相关的握手会啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36398c5cf24d0d4169497d7598e26c730296ef1378e97a5a09c90e223d921743",
      "text": "（配合商品的高级感概念，\n安排了企划，但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45e98086c7073274e2855b1b25587b5e2fc0e34fc3974bcb4829349739e940d3",
      "text": "实先生和皮埃尔倒还好说，\n我真的能胜任吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cd9bd3c1c25f969255210010f1ad10eedf910752025a9d56df78fd5e33474f6",
      "text": "（虽然以前还在老家的时候，\n也参加过社交界派对……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d20042bb07133747c01969975f8effbf2e532228f7c0faf36fe27900863a73e",
      "text": "（但就从来没有顺利和别人交流过啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1be46b938821785ffd36348554b86f6f82bcfda5540ec9c1154ff05f20dd6b4f",
      "text": "……不过嘛，也只能全力以赴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcd336c5d0e932a0b4ad11a5ab257d5dd3ee335b71b32b59464bca41df7367d1",
      "text": "今天请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1",
      "text": "请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7e2b72f34dbe218fde86432013134791a76c9f800501f7d9455312f53d6bd98",
      "text": "我们这边才是，请多关照！\n那我就立刻开始说明了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c40a2411dc9e37e0ef9266ed0394d5cb3b35c58f249a0f68d83a6fbe7cec17f",
      "text": "正如资料上记载的那样，这次希望Beit的各位\n能够出演广告，并演唱合作歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d244bdba2ffc46e69ce69c8e4b39e655b02222ff8784a74d82a40b159d3a78a3",
      "text": "还有另外一件事……我们将面向购买了商品的顾客，\n举办抽选参加的握手会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06b5eab3429605e6be4e4892c384aeedac5d6fdaf3d3107f5e0d7d4a7ca64ebd",
      "text": "握手会，能和大家聊天，好期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f89116c87feb332e21935423560b1f9f919cfff826609235752ebe22a5e9ba5b",
      "text": "这边就是本次需要各位宣传的、\n新产品鸡尾酒风软饮。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b130bf53783e694db1ca576d699ca738412d3f5639bfe61af9f86abcef3cc276",
      "text": "请务必试饮一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab405bffafdf6922867dc484170595ba00fd9c13e4650fe6ad56357521d3c674",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n……嗯，好喝！香气十分浓郁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2222385bf6a7cd8816207dfcd63d7c53213fc804683cd5136af61501ed938535",
      "text": "虽说听介绍是鸡尾酒风，\n但感觉比我以前喝过的任何酒都要好喝啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f16117475ba9f09bb39fd0e29ce8a98c9656fc8fbf9566ba994e86504cca1c",
      "text": "很好喝！\n我很喜欢这个饮料♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da36e0256085d1ea08851eee1ab8a18039af16af91e5deedf19d331f3b31160f",
      "text": "本次的产品非常注重高级感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3219280de5f7f28eb770af7143e39b50076eb9a307b965471abe6d2433ef214",
      "text": "配合广告的主题，我们构思了以冬日高贵王子为形象的\n剧情短片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc9f3bcb3800808d78a9ffec6a70dcd51f1ae6720031306a4e739e4cafe89ec5",
      "text": "因此，我们非常希望能够拜托Beit的各位，\n才提出了这份委托。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d25e23b1fc81fa0ebd8f8878d904a941f40aee6dfa7962ee51cd7e5b87a286",
      "text": "王子啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d4cb91fc0bec016b34562e014f34b632f468d237116471dd0f4cee6ff5ac954",
      "text": "呵呵。恭二，感到为难了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25945ac9dc19d3ce211ad54bbe62d5ea2539cfb060056dc2d18d63692fb44204",
      "text": "没、没有这回事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e2654bfb20516dc156e685695ee90cfa369c19eb84c17539f3803e647c385c",
      "text": "剧本还在准备中。如果各位心中已经有了画面，\n按照你们的想法来进行也是可以的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9002e33c8200212f98acfe7b26dd242f9586193072f2320f5859fc5e2c323aa7",
      "text": "请务必让我们自己来准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5774059c4c6bde3924e091bcdc1ed06b515462b7163bcc7e5385caff7bd95c80",
      "text": "诶？我可写不来剧本啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0acf0ae69639c045ebba3c274b4f6d6ecf072c0f7bff48bb7eca3625a0b18dfb",
      "text": "剧本……\n我，也能写吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5275ab46aad2f43f113f4f1b9dd1f4f61e63088135b6baa207c940b35f842fd2",
      "text": "没关系！包在我身上。\n我一定会把你们两个打造成最棒的王子的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199d2990f8143b844c3cf9f33f113b1e2d2cc928f1080882b21e9e70ad17b705",
      "text": "喔——实，干劲满满呢。\n我，非常期待。加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000098:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c06bec2d17ca298ddc78047d1048113a76b39007f0d0346335dc0372e75a243c",
      "text": "商讨结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000106:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3fa31b3101120dcacc4cbdcf4055a834f4f25f237589a2620e94d606a084066",
      "text": "商讨辛苦啦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000108:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c315f2b406166d37d283b4a21e5f34c9de38d68006aab549c9e0303c91066f58",
      "text": "给我们试饮的新产品，\n很好喝呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000110:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e218fc473eb65f3ea4327648b36186caeaaca9932191e27e0004b05924ea828c",
      "text": "在便利店就能轻松买到\n也是它的魅力所在呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000112:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b25c1f75df838a3843b37e56eaf968377ba46a0f7054530d54f1a021d895c0b4",
      "text": "甜甜的，很好喝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000114:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2678908980f13040fa716b4aef21123642fe6a98df8c35e208f5b3b4f47c7e9a",
      "text": "我\n在店里看到了就要买！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000116:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a625f105158a423073d74546e1478d4f18340b32053caa16f955c4576063ee",
      "text": "恭二先生也\n喝得很香呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000116:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78a22e553f22752c8989111679f7c7a834fd191e5ee121c61bac2061b9208351",
      "text": "恭二先生喝的时候\n看起来也觉得很好喝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000117:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab791be3dc484b1b66fe38f680a56d8f86fe3d5f455b2700c473c94b8b24f21",
      "text": "恭二先生觉得\n怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000117:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98185f460ca8fce1515f1615ed1e65fbff962618dfe116618d81e7495db73b4c",
      "text": "恭二先生尝了新产品后\n觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000121:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f8bcb5819ff20ddd8bc4f571a5eaf367843fb887923b173f0d12693825d6aad",
      "text": "本来还担心自己\n能不能尝出味道的差别，\n但一下子就喝出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000123:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0648b4bd339aa12427fa270eaa2d67f1ae113dd01ef631bf646f89e0a5fa8799",
      "text": "呵呵，是啊。\n为了把产品的魅力传达给大家，\n一起加油吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_37</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_c:cmd-000125:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "喔——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c106767c38da8cd7ffad405f7c87eda75940d8892312801737c62a0259a482",
      "text": "让大家久等了！\n广告用的剧本，我已经写好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6082e47fff3d45bf9a97dbc1189e3bd9cad3d130cdcf1356d4a932cf86e62f4",
      "text": "来，这份是恭二和皮埃尔的，\n这份是●●●●プロデューサー的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:644b21a2d878ca21f002c836cd3cd734548b04933fe2af9b0125967a95bd9e39",
      "text": "我写了好几种版本，\n挑出觉得最合适的，在正式拍摄时用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab44fe1b1ba0dcde8b73b8309fe96a615fbe0c50df8e033a12f18191cc53a600",
      "text": "实先生，非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ebb22581c229d1402fc09a60b725e5609386298bc28f243481d74d632c7e5a",
      "text": "从王子的设定开始，\n就刻画得非常细致呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b63efcd2ac2c138564cc48d11739526cd513323c64eec27130aed9a97886f07",
      "text": "我是……“霸道总裁系”吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3be6e53c66dc872e36997ef7c05b93c2db8f4e2fdb0a7b5670d921ad73706146",
      "text": "嗯！绝对能把你原本的魅力\n放大好几倍呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1ea9da80ed6d02f153e6c96c97e89cc3b84713ad92a836f5287010aeaf35f7",
      "text": "我是……“内向”和“病娇”？\n呐，实。病娇是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:add59a1743ce6c42b96d404d9f580e5e10cbc5095d2098dcc5c2b1721eb7706c",
      "text": "这个嘛……大概就是指对喜欢的人的感情\n非常强烈的状态吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecf7370caf1948888d9c5048b74d7ccef1184627b1d855a2bd5f693e1f0d9061",
      "text": "超级喜欢那个人……对吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad093beaeee2302b37502b6f2e573dee85af66e95c3734498633055fe68b98b6",
      "text": "嗯，我想正是通过展现病娇的反差，\n来牢牢抓住大家的心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97a82d29e1907cf2078f1fdc965886ba49281fbc1663571f5cd806e3b79b1527",
      "text": "超级喜欢……我知道了！\n我，要当病娇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a0b17a4fb2cf5d21a030a292ffff5deba45388c7146dd9d1f7c9095f5291ac",
      "text": "虽然我对病娇也不太懂，\n但这和皮埃尔平时的样子差得挺远吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0101c1f73f9819bc90a0255a27af730b11fcd579c132448b7af484134304179d",
      "text": "那么，实先生的设定是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_d:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1485648b164e14fa979a5830c5f12a58d1a96763506d1d3f8ee9472648db9e5c",
      "text": "我是稍微有点坏心眼的小恶魔王子。下一页写着\n各自的台词，大家看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:098e9182f7adbb5f47aefecd1140cb7699ad6af4134e44b8853008f22caab0a0",
      "text": "“你只要呆在我身边就好……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e20102fcc4ffc8debb0885dbff6bd1783f96f33ce0afb04ef5c49fdc5c04fa27",
      "text": "那个，实先生。\n真的要说这种台词吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca",
      "text": "当然了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcba8f4fb0e285be28ee589bdeb45c743e97b5b231a6ac360073f413c3c3aee9",
      "text": "这可是我分析了粉丝和客户的需求后，\n结合王子的设定深思熟虑出来的自信之作哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d88ac0344df3438f0370eb92ec407b78cbf4178144a670c904908a5b5201565",
      "text": "看了广告的大家，\n肯定都会被恭二的魅力迷得神魂颠倒的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5055761d761764caafec8564af3a15c2e4580f62a35d577bd98f6c74121945bc",
      "text": "神魂颠倒……？\n好吧，我相信实先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64ec21fd2415c7a1f0ac2e35d1c99770c065ad9c47bf41b55c12b196eeb7993d",
      "text": "我的台词，全都是平假名！\n实，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c47dfd7a78d07365d3d2f32702c86b8c39095bd17ca67ff9597dfd09a4ca68c",
      "text": "嗯……\n“只许看着我，不要把视线移开”……这样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0301c6d32f1a1c4883fc753d1fad0743e71e643dae658598ba2f18a50e1d3f90",
      "text": "很好！\n接下来为了成为合格的病娇，好好练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d56aefce91386fe8d492cef76f37e365206287d080f051f14bed8f83ab089e",
      "text": "嗯！我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:187f9def42dd98ecbe40a94d5d77fcee26801d83142116e12026cc44c362ee72",
      "text": "接下来就是课程的日程安排了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9531efba9b3e19b407cac01efc67ad4e232b1d0d67d1d70616472eecd5fc5bd3",
      "text": "好的。练习室已经按照这样约好了。\n能请各位确认一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00e3f6b5fb9876e9a013e9219dc3f2e79cf6d5ed702cebf9fcacff7072246241",
      "text": "我看看……嗯，没问题！\n谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecf934d57ff2d1f9d9f89d6e89073d26cc53713b90a2b64c620aaf6ba811d968",
      "text": "对了，反正都要练，\n不如用手机录下来试试？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a622e5c482418336385d9739877cc9b2455c5eabb230acee65371194b468116",
      "text": "比如想从这种角度拍、想拍这样的镜头，\n实际录下来看看效果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:803ffc96487d957ebf1765268a72dd1c02c8599ddeec272275f044f848cd46f9",
      "text": "下次商讨的时候，\n我想把这个带给对方看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11c56a04638b8e7170752bc03e3983d01dba3853def974f5e57729c59e40ccf4",
      "text": "那样的话沟通起来确实会更顺畅呢。\n我觉得挺好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1180e66a9935e87492be640e90afa250e6734f2d3eadb779dfadd05162f90900",
      "text": "好像很有意思。\n我也赞成！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1839f5c26e897db9598924f660d19a2f2c17c47dd5652d0cdb06b4ea13d3a3",
      "text": "好的，\n那就由我来负责拍摄吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b98315469d67ce85146546709a6c14fda3149c21905bec4a045007a69088829",
      "text": "谢啦，拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20cb3a957ec5befc563bb5b63311f717b1f4a48b6a568ca93aa103184f2a7688",
      "text": "“哎呀，脸怎么这么红。\n是醉倒在气氛中了呢？还是醉倒在我身上了呢？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46618a1fd235a636db86009d16ef5cf75b02f811b66a9f5fb46f1e787224afb7",
      "text": "“来，转过来看我。\n让我好好看一看可爱的你。……好吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a1cdaf229b297587279899dea947e236487c858464743a5a96e95c4e783ea49",
      "text": "喔——实，好帅！\n我，心跳加速了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c8222d6a0ccbb24cf732c21d3f1ed4610be37d5abf18ca198f9b7294fafc9b",
      "text": "不愧是实先生……非常有模有样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b83892db259d79237da16b06fdb9a98e11064de0d1245623ecb23e6812731a8e",
      "text": "啊哈哈，谢谢。\n被你们这么夸我都害羞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12a59114539ad341903f1d7302fa5dd7467fa8bb7879e34671e085adf9ee51af",
      "text": "面对镜头的表现也堪称完美……！\n完全看不出是第一次尝试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e60eac7e48be3486a930d4c02f99e98d4104b348346216deb15ccaa222c0c3e9",
      "text": "毕竟为了今天做了很多研究嘛。\n能有成效真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3626515c607b4b8bc064577c12aacfcd08b4837b90ea424cbf2c7533d04694c7",
      "text": "来，皮埃尔和恭二也试一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb4aae5bae9a41e725d85f79027f7d9ee1686e6df8d23c636f66349fcae64c41",
      "text": "“我比任何人都喜欢你。\n想要一直一直……永远陪在你身边”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ed6664764b6effe3c8acfbb1abdc7e0e65c87af4bc1ff22e7f80cd9f57c1ed6",
      "text": "“所以……我要让你\n除了我以外什么都无法去想”……怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee82dd57defcecb1d1bedc791008232cd1aa1ec75aeb2ccd4b1322fcb5827e5",
      "text": "皮埃尔……！！太棒了！\n甚至超出了我的想象……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fd8643734dc947da0cc6b321aea8b79be824fc47a2fd95ad39de9ee4c6514d9",
      "text": "居然是这种感觉吗……\n皮埃尔一演起戏来，整个人气场真的彻底变了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:883f9b5789d17d462d21e85c1cb5fc32a89da25119243f4c865c9b91038c68b1",
      "text": "正是实先生所说的那种反差呢。\n把皮埃尔先生全新的魅力引出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26714ae1ad9a2a84899ec2966d8ad78690a754c705f01cd0f7dc81d7c6601df5",
      "text": "呀呼——！我也和实一样。\n练习了，很多次。接下来轮到恭二了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc2394e0b158d849f7232bb7631ef9444aa9120b0363f0f47b84e5898553159b",
      "text": "啊、啊啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5191149ccae47b800ae30dad90c15b8edc10e900a6f55151e5cf9548f72493e1",
      "text": "“你什么都不用说，只要呆在我身边就好”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84db3efe2457ae891b18a2944b56274f3ebba3aa0ec53403925a88e097b458e9",
      "text": "“哼。你以为你还有拒绝的权利吗？\n因为你已经是属于我的了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d791b2334b35ac5b29635fda573680f467cc4e9b569589a1700da70f31e78a46",
      "text": "啊啊……多么傲慢啊……！\n恭二，太棒了。太精彩了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56d42fa217989b5b83fc0ef8c17d7d0b615c0a3ab8699a39aea8a28da3dabba0",
      "text": "是的！恭二先生也非常出色。\n对方肯定也会非常高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70bc5af778e83016788eaa56f3178cc9d567f38557a4fe03951b2cc1f6b01cb",
      "text": "恭二，好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78cd1242d86b59ae44d9cb1b70d6b9d70ed39c966bb0c63c34b05e657a5626f0",
      "text": "虽然现在这个状态已经足够好了，\n但包括我在内，感觉还可以进一步打磨呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:542a36276a4317d1160da34bae21b9fc2fd70f661ba5184313278c610ffef871",
      "text": "保持这个势头继续练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000175:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0533fbe348f9129e02897baa687e0b5aa2cd081ae6453043621604c77a546493",
      "text": "正式拍摄后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0440bbec65624fd531bf7357f1336d07d156efaa0e9b1b48756e4adaaa495657",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天拍广告，辛苦了——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49da394294f32ee4d2ff18022711fe9c57115653633cd47177849649e96f2e8f",
      "text": "拍摄，好开心。\n实和恭二，好厉害呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7349c9b93e8ccb16718fa0b5147aaa8031f4c6a57dc067ffede7c615525a43a",
      "text": "他们两个也对我说，很多次\n表现很好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000200:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e98cb71bfea9b7f55cd3f9745407e31a1addb779367a8668fa4616a06c6557cc",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，陪我们\n做了好多好多练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000202:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2117bd6a95fd01907a5d45134acb695c1e74bbfe77013e62d4a7ca1b3f775fd0",
      "text": "所以大家，才能演得那么好！\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000204:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55267033e627b54477d7cdeebfe8b2498bc944bda46da033015c8345866bfb58",
      "text": "能帮上忙，\n那就太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2652f2cc02a4382db599edfd5b59d8e7f9727808df174d1638c807630b2c1640",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿♪拍摄结束了，接下来是握手会，对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66b305f68f8e06e2be0cd55bc16108c7cafa46e1468eac0f17059abd38019596",
      "text": "我，要和大家握好多手。\n能见到大家，超级期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_h:cmd-000211:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d54f5fec70cd268b2e0ea347bf052b19074b7aacdcaa68eb4b6ca8aa83e34327",
      "text": "制作人，明天见咯。\n晚安。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3edd5c003d02a7c01f70c67d77f3e10d6bae5d32ea55d15fe05719b7a53ca3a",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿♪\n和大家一起拍摄，好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:300f22f046b222b1c5f589e6a1e550d3018a643f05382eb15e737d1135f8278a",
      "text": "“这瓶饮料，你之前说过很喜欢的吧？\n……笨蛋，我怎么可能会忘”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:866fd819fdb4858e195128b4e4d4df5c357a2078a4726daa4f336664baddf1be",
      "text": "“能让我做到这种地步的女人，只有你一个。\n给我感到光荣吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41c174ecf8b0eaf84bf9728c582450439f32876f8c1351676c19cf99da56ec0b",
      "text": "“呐，这么毫无防备的样子，\n可不能给其他任何人看哦？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94b678b0052b3a5c104bf0dac962d4aabf7873aff73c3bd6a2f660245b7a3f48",
      "text": "“因为你的一切，全都是属于我的……\n呵呵。要不再来干一杯吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e16cb0d887afb2ddfe107f1c8abb33d1984ca577f73b12b0d8f1af3c608d00b",
      "text": "“来，给你续杯。……啊，喝完了？\n呵呵。其实刚才那杯饮料，我施了魔法哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac395226b0cdc4ef3b1b1503816a73707abc96fe5950b9e48cedf3021e55e25",
      "text": "“你问是什么魔法？也是呢，要是你对我说\n喜欢我的话，我就告诉你吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba1830d39e79bc0a4b3cdac697fc678c515d428b5f02551f46baf238a7bbff08",
      "text": "“与你共度甜蜜绝顶的至高时光。\n为我们沉醉吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_i:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f5dec04bef7048872a9307ff7f34fb5c8494074d856b2208381c1d25f2deb79",
      "text": "这个广告，大家要是能喜欢就好了。\n青蛙酱，你也这么觉得吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c45bbb97527394569592a790ad47b2e498c3d5769993745fec005ff2ba69ee",
      "text": "握手会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a300cdf7b354e934a06586730fdcb60cde7fc6a0207e902f00e49f23ebb6a58c",
      "text": "从Beit出道起，我就一直在支持你们！\n广告里的台词，真的太迷人了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d86e460b5461c2444cdf1bcf2526d11fc5591bf1f4aa55f6ea75189372445e28",
      "text": "谢谢！3个人的台词都是我想的，\n你能这么说我真高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e53fb9e3c1391670bb49ef68eb9462df12d15ce59921d73299dc75529ef9de",
      "text": "要是方便的话，能告诉我谁的台词最让你心动吗？\n我可以作为参考呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:816772e754b336a39087293c6a808b77cfd34003afbb951ea05c11a6e78d2db9",
      "text": "广告里的皮埃尔君，说话方式和平时不一样，\n这种反差感真的太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6218a711dd3b21a6fa45b886e200eb046825748741259f56ebfe10fb403465c7",
      "text": "真的吗？我，做了好多好多练习！\n诶嘿嘿……谢谢你看我们的广告。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39344a0714bfcf64d1faa53c427affc081012adc22cd26c05a1727d574e7e39d",
      "text": "广告，还会继续播的哦。大家要，\n多多看我们哦。约定好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5a21c4a347d3e6cc5a847cc15893d35a3f3febea9eab1b76ed77576651a4b12",
      "text": "那个！虽然我以前不太了解Beit，\n但是看了广告之后就成了你们的粉丝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de851510797853858699d097470eeedc42971e5c56b44aa4927c0d42115901ae",
      "text": "为了来参加握手会，我买了好多商品，\n终于抽中了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b8ef44fad48c834d62a181b374909e75190a47f8d271ef5ab3f56311073cf6a",
      "text": "！这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd1530646c5882f468d1ce0556fad352d813459cfe76bb2fd87633591475dc87",
      "text": "那个，谢了。\n可以的话，今后也请多多关照我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dbdfa3d7348ef05ac47bb69195b8f93fc29cff11817f8004dbd9790d9931974",
      "text": "握手会结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:218745d9391e843f706f3fde6bafcb804519a32cf5b387c719d29282c01d4e7e",
      "text": "各位辛苦了！\n握手会感觉如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3c8becfd728a171f813bd290b892b650ea10ea36f0a332facbc036882ad08f4",
      "text": "很开心哦。能直接从粉丝那里听到感想，\n真的很让人高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d33f0c95078bca5ae4b72814336a7345027624abf09eae541b282a6c8aecabf3",
      "text": "我也是。\n和大家聊了好多话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:921a1da5ef520a4e713f1f9ec32b0b361c5b3e20dad5524e796e5d17524f5c54",
      "text": "也有人说是因为这次的广告才认识我们的。\n这让我觉得要更加努力才行，获得了前进的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04cbc366ae6166db1baa86e28f730f1df0264731c3dd0fccbbe923b22143c102",
      "text": "真的很感激大家呢。各位粉丝，\n就是我们偶像力量的源泉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0d656526ba85b33926612642ea73a294fc5586e88e2f47f0d1521d64909ea1",
      "text": "是啊。为了那些支持我们的人，\n不得不拼尽全力了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:994bffee07de62cbdf2047b7506f94dd3564b24925977f3d98c5ca9ec0491d00",
      "text": "改天我们再为这次的工作办个庆功宴吧！\n带上我们宣传的饮料和好吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af538e2ece8202a0bb27b36a7f5333fa23d4faffd2c8a923ab8d99f4a6c9cf4",
      "text": "哇啊，好棒！\n我，想聊好多今天的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcda7670a975f02542cadd36280b18bf54159bba3110e700d0e65b552de52c7",
      "text": "好啊。好好聊聊吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー，也会来的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
